OL,3,ASister of Pakistan's ex-PM Imran Khan
OL,4,Aarrested
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe sister of Pakistan's imprisoned
OL,7,Fformer prime minister, Imran Khan, has
OL,8,Fbeen arrested ahead of next week's
OL,9,Fprotests held in his support, his
OL,10,FPakistan Tehreek-e-Insaf (PTI) party
OL,11,Fhas said.
OL,13,FAleema Khanum was detained in the
OL,14,Feastern city of Lahore on Sunday
OL,15,Fafternoon, PTI officials said, calling
OL,16,Fit an "illegal detention". Her son is
OL,17,Fdemanding her return.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
