OL,3,ASister of Pakistan's ex-PM Imran Khan
OL,4,Aarrested
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe order for Khanum's arrest, which
OL,7,Fcame from Lahore's deputy commissioner,
OL,8,Falleged that she was mobilising Imran
OL,9,FKhan's supporters "through social media
OL,10,Fand public meetings". It added that she
OL,11,Fwill be detained for 30 days.
OL,13,FKhanum is a vocal critic of her
OL,14,Fbrother's detention, regularly speaking
OL,15,Fto his supporters and the media.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
